  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想不到能在這種地方\n遇見卡娜莉狂熱問答王。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F34E0D523080FD572890197A2E573065B9000A9047898B53615A1C838972C271B1554F7B54738B300200100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "身為問答王想必<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一定知道，\n提到卡娜莉小姐的搭檔，就是麻麻鰻魚王。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8EAB70BA554F7B54738B60F35FC500100003110000FF01014F6059B34E005B9A77E59053FF0C000A63D0523053615A1C83895C0F59D07684642D6A94FF0C5C31662F9EBB9EBB9C3B9B5A738B300200100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了能有與卡娜莉小姐一樣的搭檔寶可夢，\n我正在培育麻麻鰻。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E8680FD6709820753615A1C83895C0F59D04E006A237684642D6A945BF653EF5922FF0C000A62116B63572857F980B29EBB9EBB9C3B300200100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "現在只剩下用雷之石將最強的麻麻鰻\n進化成麻麻鰻魚王了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73FE572853EA52694E0B752896F74E4B77F35C0767005F3776849EBB9EBB9C3B000A9032531662109EBB9EBB9C3B9B5A738B4E86300200100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而在此時，我竟然遇上了問答王。\n這真是奇蹟啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C57286B646642FF0C62117ADF713690474E0A4E86554F7B54738B3002000A9019771F662F59478E5F554AFF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請和我對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n好讓我選出最強、最帶電的\n麻麻鰻！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB548C62115C0D62305427FF0100100001BE01000A597D8B936211907851FA67005F37300167005E3696FB7684000A9EBB9EBB9C3BFF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好要對戰，\n就請來告訴我。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D89815C0D6230FF0C000A5C318ACB4F86544A8A346211300200100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請和我對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n好讓我選出最強、最帶電的\n麻麻鰻！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB548C62115C0D62305427FF0100100001BE01000A597D8B936211907851FA67005F37300167005E3696FB7684000A9EBB9EBB9C3BFF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "樂意奉陪！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6A02610F5949966AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一等",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E007B490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然！當然！\n我會等著<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75767136FF0175767136FF01000A621167037B49845700100003110000FF01014F6059B37684FF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要借助卡娜莉狂熱問答王的實力，\n看清哪隻才是最強的麻麻鰻！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118981501F52A953615A1C838972C271B1554F7B54738B76845BE6529BFF0C000A770B6E0554EA96BB624D662F67005F3776849EBB9EBB9C3BFF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "變成對戰特區啦！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n這下不是寶可夢對戰的時候了，\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳改天再來吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B8A62105C0D6230727953405566FF0100100001BE01000A90194E0B4E0D662F5BF653EF59225C0D62307684664250194E86FF0C000A8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B365395929518D4F865427FF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真不愧是卡娜莉狂熱問答王！\n連寶可夢對戰的手腕也是頂級的！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F4E0D6127662F53615A1C838972C271B1554F7B54738BFF01000A90235BF653EF59225C0D62307684624B81554E5F662F98027D1A7684FF01FF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然我輸了，但我決定好\n哪隻才是要用雷之石進化的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n最強、最帶電的麻麻鰻了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713662118F384E86FF0C4F4662116C7A5B9A597D000A54EA96BB624D662F8981752896F74E4B77F390325316768400100001BE00000A67005F37300167005E3696FB76849EBB9EBB9C3B4E86FF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你想得太簡單了，宇滿！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6060F35F97592A7C2155AE4E86FF0C5B876EFFFF0100100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "瑪迷前輩，\n我哪裡錯了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "746A8FF7524D8F29FF0C000A621154EA88E1932F4E8655CEFF1F00100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們的卡娜莉小姐她那隻\n麻麻鰻魚王，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n並不是天生強大的麻麻鰻……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115011768453615A1C83895C0F59D0597990A396BB000A9EBB9EBB9C3B9B5A738BFF0C00100001BE00000A4E264E0D662F5929751F5F37592776849EBB9EBB9C3B2026202600100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而是卡娜莉小姐將牠從弱小的麻麻鰻\n鍛鍊成最強的麻麻鰻魚王的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C662F53615A1C83895C0F59D05C0772605F9E5F315C0F76849EBB9EBB9C3B000A935B934A621067005F3776849EBB9EBB9C3B9B5A738B7684FF0100100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我渾身發麻了……！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116E3E8EAB767C9EBB4E8620262026FF01FF0100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "麻麻嘛……！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9EBB9EBB561B20262026FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然隻隻麻麻鰻都可愛，\n那就全部都愛。這才是真卡友吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E2713696BB96BB9EBB9EBB9C3B90FD53EF611BFF0C000A90A35C31516890E890FD611B30029019624D662F771F536153CB5427300200100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的戰友！\n深深感謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳陪宇滿對戰！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117684623053CBFF01000A6DF16DF1611F8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3966A5B876EFF5C0D6230FF0100100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宇滿，為了提升來電伍的凝聚力，\n我倆卡友這就一起來特訓吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B876EFFFF0C70BA4E8663D053474F8696FB4F0D768451DD805A529BFF0C000A62115006536153CB90195C314E008D774F8672798A135427FF0100100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    }
